ine).\n    *   **2) Visible text:**\n        *   Logo: \"WebScene\"\n        *   Nav: \"Home\", \"Workspace\", \"Activity\"\n        *   Heading: \"Nearby cafés\"\n        *   Item 1: \"Pine Café\", \"4 min walk\"\n        *   Item 2: \"Oak Corner\", \"View details\"\n        *   Item 3: \"River Point\", \"View details\"\n        *   Item 4: \"Central Stop\", \"View details\"\n    *   **3) Inputs:** No form fields visible. (List empty or state none).\n    *   **4) State signals:** No loading spinners, toasts, modals, error banners, success messages, CAPTCHAs, or cookie banners visible.\n    *   **5) Blockers:** None apparent.\n    *   **6) Unknowns:** The icon on the red map pins is slightly blurry but looks like an 'N' or a generic symbol; cannot definitively identify it. The blue line on the map has no labels.\n\n4.  **Refining and Formatting:**\n\n    *   *Check rules:* No prose intro, no conclusion, no \"this screenshot shows...\".\n    *   *Format:*\n        1) Page purpose: ...\n        2) Visible text: ...\n        3) Inputs: ...\n        4) State signals: ...\n        5) Blockers: ...\n        6) Unknowns","role":"assistant"},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

